From 850acef6e36e83c6f4a054517a8c4b2b14d6fe79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pieroviano <piero.viano@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 02:49:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Underline the access key at rest on every caption;
 ToolStripStatusLabel constructors apply their arguments; tray label drops a
 trailing ampersand

GTK 4 draws a mnemonic underline only while Alt is held. Mnemonics.Apply sets the caption through
the label's markup-with-mnemonic path with the key wrapped in <u>, so it is underlined at rest
and still an Alt access key, with no double underline. Button, CheckBox, RadioButton, Label,
GroupBox and the menu/tool-strip items all go through it.
